appalchemist (1.7.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Resolve data paths compiled into applications so bundles find their own
    files instead of looking for them on the host.
  * Install the icon the desktop entries refer to.
  * Add --bundle-deps to fetch and bundle declared dependencies.

 -- AppAlchemist Team <appalchemist@example.com>  Thu, 18 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000

appalchemist (1.6.1-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Point AppRun at the application binary of Electron packages instead of
    their command line wrapper.
  * Recognise private runtimes kept under usr/lib/<app> again.

 -- AppAlchemist Team <appalchemist@example.com>  Thu, 18 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000

appalchemist (1.6.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Converted AppImages no longer ship broken or shadowed libraries.
  * Harden archive extraction, subprocess execution and dependency resolution.
  * Add the headless appalchemist-cli converter alongside the GTK interface.

 -- AppAlchemist Team <appalchemist@example.com>  Wed, 17 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000

appalchemist (1.5.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Synchronize packaging metadata with the public v1.5.0 release.
  * Document .deb, .rpm and archive conversion workflows.
  * Keep GTK4/libadwaita frontend requirements visible.

